# ==============================================================================
# DG-NET  —  STAGE 2: DG-GAN  (Distortion-Guided Image Restorer)
# DTD-FSRN dataset  |  Based on Thapa et al., ICCV 2021
#
# Prerequisite: Stage 1 (dgnet_stage1_disnet.py) must be complete.
#   Required files:
#     /kaggle/working/dgnet_stage1/checkpoints/disnet_final.pth
#     /kaggle/working/dgnet_stage1/checkpoints/warp_stats.json
#
# What this stage does:
#   1. Load the trained Dis-Net (frozen) to predict warp fields.
#   2. Apply backward warp to produce a coarsely-corrected image J_W.
#   3. Feed J_W into a U-Net generator G that refines it into a clean image Ĵ.
#   4. Train G against a PatchGAN discriminator D using distortion-guided losses
#      (Thapa et al. §3.2, Eq. 8 & 9):
#        L_G  =  L1(G(J_W), J)  +  L2(G(J_W), J)  +  L2(F(G(J_W), W), I)
#        L_GAN conditioned on distortion map W
#
# Resumable:
#   Full state saved atomically every epoch.
#   Set EPOCHS_PER_RUN and re-run to continue from the last checkpoint.
#
# Outputs:
#   /kaggle/working/dgnet_stage2/checkpoints/resume_state.pth
#   /kaggle/working/dgnet_stage2/checkpoints/generator_epoch{N}.pth
#   /kaggle/working/dgnet_stage2/checkpoints/generator_final.pth
#   /kaggle/working/dgnet_stage2/epoch_loss_log.csv
#   /kaggle/working/dgnet_stage2/samples/epoch_{N:03d}.png
#   /kaggle/working/dgnet_stage2/evaluation_results.json
# ==============================================================================

